{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06926","headline":"古兴 · 常建","name":"古兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉上逢老翁，江口爲僵屍。\n白发沾黄泥，遗骸集乌鸱。\n机巧自此忘，精魄今何之。\n风吹钓竿折，鱼跃安能施。\n白水明汀洲，菰蒲冒深陂。\n唯留扁舟影，系在长江湄。\n突兀枯松枝，悠扬女萝丝。\n托身难凭依，生死焉相知。\n徧观今时人，举世皆尔爲。\n将军死重围，汉卒犹争驰。\n百马同一衔，万轮同一规。\n名与身孰亲，君子宜固思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}